WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:02.049
A schema with three empty slots.

2
00:00:02.800 --> 00:00:04.187
Prefill the prompt once.

3
00:00:05.300 --> 00:00:07.497
Copy that cache into one lane per field.

4
00:00:08.800 --> 00:00:10.848
Advance every lane in a single pass.

5
00:00:12.300 --> 00:00:16.375
Then take the softmax over only the tokens
the schema still allows.

6
00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:18.021
The slots fill.

7
00:00:18.021 --> 00:00:19.517
Valid by construction.

8
00:00:20.600 --> 00:00:22.008
One prompt, one pass.
